{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚方駿米線示愛 鄺港智自辯 前夫鄺港智 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）案情披 …</p><p></p>\n<p>譚方駿米線示愛 鄺港智自辯 前夫鄺港智 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）案情披露出人意表的關係說法，死者32歲前夫鄺港智Alex不但稱離婚後仍與蔡天鳳保持親密關係，更把蔡天鳳丈夫譚方駿牽入其中。由一碗米線到三人同床，庭上證供令案中人物關係出現震撼轉折。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%9b%a2%e5%a9%9a-%e7%b5%90%e5%a9%9a-%e6%8b%8d%e6%8b%96-%e5%86%8d%e5%a9%9a-%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e5%ad%b8%e6%a0%a1-2457076/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳譚方駿拍拖另有原因 鄺港智剖白前妻再婚感受 披露三人關係</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港智親述譚方駿買米線示愛 三人同床</h2>\n<p>鄺港智在庭上聲稱譚方駿「本身係鍾意我」，更指對方曾「買碗米線嚟同我示愛」。他表示譚方駿昔日每天到黃埔花園探望，又形容兩人「唔應該用朋友形容，應該用家人」。他表示譚家想要小朋友，家人不介意他們「三個一齊」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%82%a2%e8%a7%a3-%e7%b4%85%e8%98%bf%e8%94%94%e6%b1%81-%e7%b4%85%e8%89%b2%e6%b6%b2%e9%ab%94-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af-2456770/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球親述處理蔡遺體經過 控方逼問1破綻：知唔知會累到個仔？</a></p>\n<p>鄺亦稱，蔡天鳳與譚方駿曾到海口探望他，三人一度同床而睡；另一次眾人於廣州入住同一酒店房間，又稱與蔡天鳳離婚後仍有性關係，二人曾親吻。</p>\n<h2>鄺家三父子認阻埋葬謀殺仍待審</h2>\n<p>事件最後出現關鍵轉折：法官早前向陪審團交代，鄺港智、鄺港傑及鄺球均否認謀殺蔡天鳳，但三人已全部承認一項阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。換言之，庭上曝光的親密關係與示愛說法雖引起震撼，仍未為案件核心控罪畫上句號，三人所面對的謀殺罪名仍在審理中。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e7%9c%8b%e5%9c%96%e4%bd%9c%e6%96%87-%e4%b8%bb%e6%8e%a7%e5%ae%98%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%bb%98%e8%aa%8d-2456137/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑答控方疑不攻自破洩密「佢講最後果句已經默認咗」</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179195450044623357_15410854546acf0e452ad08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 譚方駿（圖片來源：有線新聞）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179195450044623357_15410854546acf0e452ad08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚方駿（圖片來源：有線新聞）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e5%88%87%e5%89%b2%e9%81%ba%e9%ab%94-%e8%82%a2%e8%a7%a3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2456635/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球認1罪名全負責與兒子無關 憶鄺港傑來電內容哭泣 法官問是否需要暫停</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-bb%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-%e5%b7%a5%e5%85%b7-2456399/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球親解龍尾村各項工具用途 大湯煲及嬰兒浴盆用途曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%9c%b0%e7%94%a2-%e5%bb%a3%e5%b7%9e%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3-%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e6%94%b6%e5%85%a5-2456370/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜69歲鄺球出庭自揭背景 離開警隊原因 公開收入來源 稱曾給3千萬蔡天鳳</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-14%e5%90%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-2455975/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑棄指控父親鄺球為兇手原因 揭買大湯煲作用 網民：笑到碌地</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%80%a0%e5%81%87-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e7%94%9f%e6%97%a5-2455192/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑認花2年造假終講真相 答「是否自認聰明」旁聽爆笑 鄺港智呈獄中信大踢爆</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑稱胞弟鄺港智殺害蔡天鳳 原因盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%89%e4%ba%ba%e5%90%8c%e5%ba%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">三人同床</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b1%b3%e7%b7%9a%e7%a4%ba%e6%84%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">米線示愛</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚方駿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：有線新聞資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2457104\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.025499+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1368,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:38:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:49.939505+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:49.939505+00:00","content_hash":"5cec2ce9a7ccb5fd4c10dcc42cab4beeb0903fa072e4208abfd8c80e89178e24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}